OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity reverses ban on
OL,4,Acollarettes at Remembrance service
OL,5,
OL,6,FQueen's University Belfast (QUB) has
OL,7,Freversed a decision to ban the wearing
OL,8,Fof collarettes at its Remembrance
OL,9,FSunday service.
OL,11,FA document setting out arrangements for
OL,12,Fnext month's wreath-laying ceremony,
OL,13,Fseen by BBC News NI, stated: "Please
OL,14,Fnote that collarettes are not to be
OL,15,Fworn."
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,420,410,260,120,0,100
