OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity reverses ban on
OL,4,Acollarettes at Remembrance service
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe move was criticised by the
OL,7,Funiversity's Young Unionists club,
OL,8,Fwhich said that banning collarettes -
OL,9,Fsuch as those worn by Orange Order
OL,10,Fmembers - "reinforces the perception
OL,11,Famong some unionist students that
OL,12,FQueen's remains a cold house for their
OL,13,Fcommunity".
OL,15,FIn a statement, QUB said that "having
OL,16,Flistened to feedback" it had "agreed
OL,17,Fthat they can continue to be worn".
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
